"class=\"underline\" href=\"https://portail-api.meteofrance.fr/web/en/"
"DonneesPubliquesBRA/license\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" >Météo-"
"France open-data licence</a>. Each service retains the intellectual property "
"in its own data. Full attribution details are in the <a class=\"underline\" "
"href=\"%(colophon_url)s\">colophon</a>."
msgstr ""

msgid "6. Provider disclaimers"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Each avalanche warning service publishes its bulletin for information "
"purposes and sets its own terms for the use of that data. Those terms apply "
"to you as a reader of Snowdesk exactly as they would on the service's own "
"site."
msgstr ""

